<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ford estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ford estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst John Kirnan raised earnings estimates on Ford Motor Co after the company reported first-quarter earnings per share of $1.20, well above Wall Street estimates.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 view to $4.65 from $4.00 and 1998 estimate to $5.00 from $4.50.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/2 at 34-1/4.</p>
</text>
